# ─── AI Configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# OPTION A — Production (recommended, secure):
#   1. Deploy the Edge Function:  supabase functions deploy ai-chat
#   2. Set the server-side secret: supabase secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#   3. Enable the proxy below:
#
# VITE_USE_AI_PROXY=true
#
# OPTION B — Local development only (key is visible in browser bundle):
#   Paste your OpenAI key below. NEVER commit a real key to git.
#
# VITE_OPENAI_KEY=sk-your-key-here
#
# OPTION C — No key (default):
#   VEDA uses the built-in deterministic planning engine.
#   Free, instant, fully functional for budget/timeline/vendor planning.
#   Upgrade to Option A for true conversational GPT-4o responses.
